-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §15 מורה בבית-ספר יסודי: the full-position
-- week of a primary-school teacher — 36 hours, of which 26 frontal, 5
-- individual and 5 stay hours — what the stay hours are for, and the week
-- of a grade coordinator in a primary school with grades 7–9.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `15 מורה בבית-ספר יסודי`

-- akn:art_15 The opening: the week of a teacher in a 100% position under the reform, set out in (א)–(ה).

@ref akn:art_15__para_a akn:art_15__para_b akn:art_15__para_c akn:art_15__para_d
`a primary teacher's full week` MEANS `a week of` 26 5 5

`hours of a primary teacher's full week` MEANS 36

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a primary teacher's full week` EQUALS `hours of a primary teacher's full week`

-- (ג): the individual hours are with a group of up to 5 pupils or one
-- pupil; their content is the principal's, under a general instruction of
-- the Ministry. "עד 5 תלמידים" counts the pupils of a group, and a group of
-- 5 is within it: an exception to convention thresholds.until, recorded
-- there with its reason.
GIVEN pupils IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a group for individual hours in a primary school` pupils IF
    pupils AT LEAST 1 AND pupils AT MOST 5

DECLARE `stay activity` IS ONE OF
    `work meetings`
    `preparing learning materials and planning the teaching`
    `individual meetings with parents`
    `checking work and examinations`

-- (ד)(1): work meetings up to 2 weekly hours (the pedagogic council, the
-- subject teams with their coordinators, the multi-professional teams);
-- (2): the rest of the stay hours on the three activities listed.
@ref akn:art_15__para_d__subpara_1 akn:art_15__para_d__subpara_2 akn:art_15__para_d__subpara_2/p2 akn:art_15__para_d__subpara_2/p3 akn:art_15__para_d__subpara_2/p4
`work meetings a week at most, in a primary school` MEANS 2

GIVEN `meeting hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the stay hours are lawfully divided` `meeting hours` IF
        `meeting hours` AT LEAST 0
    AND `meeting hours` AT MOST `work meetings a week at most, in a primary school`
    AND `meeting hours` AT MOST `a primary teacher's full week`'s `stay hours`

-- (ה): a grade coordinator in a primary school with grades 7, 8 or 9: the
-- week by the number of classes in the grade, from the table. The rows
-- are "עד 4", "5 - 6", "7 - 8" and "9 ומעלה", counts of whole classes; the
-- second row opens at 5, so "עד 4" holds 4 (an exception to convention
-- thresholds.until, recorded there).
@ref akn:art_15__para_e akn:art_15__para_e/t1
GIVEN classes IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `work week`
DECIDE `a primary grade coordinator's week` classes IS
    BRANCH IF classes AT MOST 4 THEN `a week of` 26 4 6
           IF classes AT MOST 6 THEN `a week of` 25 3 8
           IF classes AT MOST 8 THEN `a week of` 24 3 9
           OTHERWISE                 `a week of` 23 3 10

-- Every row of the table adds up to the 36 hours of (א).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN c YIELD `hours of the week` (`a primary grade coordinator's week` c) EQUALS 36) (range 1 12)
#ASSERT `the stay hours are lawfully divided` 2
#ASSERT NOT `the stay hours are lawfully divided` 2.5
#ASSERT `a group for individual hours in a primary school` 5
